      "content": "i already tried that. i emailed the support address for the forum and the email bounced back with a \"non-existent recipient\" error. then i checked my secondary backup email to see if i could recover the forum login, and that account has been deactivated too. it's not just a \"glitch\" if multiple, unrelated platforms are failing at the exact same time. it feels targeted. it's like there's a pattern to what's disappearing. do you see how that looks? if it were just a server error, why would it hit my forum, my drive links, and my backup email all in the same 48 hour window?",
